  "version": "0.0.1",
  "description": "The economy engine: goods, recipes, inventories, markets (stock, consumption, reserve, production, price), labour market, trade and transport, organisations, business accounting. A reducer plus a daily tick; no game imports. The pirate ports are its first client.",
